---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Register an MCP server

Usage: sbt mcp add [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Server name

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --url <URL>
          The server's URL

      --header <NAME: VALUE>
          A request header, `Name: value` (repeatable). `${name}` in the value is the secret `mcp:<server>:<name>`

      --command <COMMAND>
          A command that runs the server inside the sandbox

      --args <ARGS>
          An argument of --command (repeatable)

  -h, --help
          Print help
